00:12:14,117 --> 00:12:20,117
In a Valley of Violence is a western, action film directed by Ti West.

3
00:18:21,176 --> 00:18:27,176
The story of a drifter named Paul who arrives in a small town
seeking revenge on the thugs who murdered his friend.

4
00:24:28,235 --> 00:24:34,235
Sisters Mary Anne and Ellen, who run the town's hotel,
help Paul in his quest for vengeance.

5
00:30:35,294 --> 00:30:41,294
Paul, played by Ethan Hawke.

6
00:36:42,352 --> 00:36:48,352
The Marshal, played by John Travolta.

7
00:42:49,411 --> 00:42:55,411
Mary Anne, played by Taissa Farmiga.

8
00:48:56,470 --> 00:49:02,470
Gilly, played by James Ransone.

9
00:55:03,529 --> 00:55:09,529
Ellen, played by Karen Gillan.

10
01:01:10,588 --> 01:01:16,588
Priest, played by Burn Gorman.

11
01:07:17,647 --> 01:07:23,647
In a Valley of Violence is a 2016 American Western
film written and directed by Ti West.

12
01:13:24,705 --> 01:13:30,705
Jason Blum serves as producer through his
production company Blumhouse Productions.

13
01:19:31,764 --> 01:19:37,764
The film stars Ethan Hawke, Taissa Farmiga, James
Ransone, Karen Gillan, and John Travolta.

14
01:25:38,823 --> 01:25:44,823
In a Valley of Violence had its world premiere at South by Southwest on March 12, 2016, and was released
in a limited release and through video on demand on October 21, 2016, by Focus World.

15
01:31:45,882 --> 01:31:51,882
The film was a commercial failure grossing only $61,797, but received critical
praise for the screenplay, direction, and the performances.

16
01:37:52,941 --> 01:37:58,941
The film explores themes of civil war, revenge, murder, killer, dog.
